Package: m6APrediction
Title: Predict m6A Sites Using a Random Forest Model
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Ziyue", "Ding",
           email = "3569776901@qq.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions for predicting N6-methyladenosine
    (m6A) sites using a fitted random forest classifier. DNA sequences
    are encoded as nucleotide-position categorical factors. Batch and
    single-observation prediction functions return positive-class
    probabilities and classification results using a user-defined
    decision threshold. Includes a fitted model and example input data
    for demonstrating the prediction workflow.
